<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dillon, Read starts two banks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dillon, Read starts two banks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon, Read &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of two regional bank stocks.</p>
<p>-- It rated BB&amp;T Corp with a buy rating and a 12-to-18 month price target of $53. The stock was up 7/8 at 45.</p>
<p>-- It rated First Union Corp a buy with a 12-to-18 month target of $115. It was off 7/8 to 93-1/8.</p>
</text>
